[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950139791","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103190#issuecomment-2950139791","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103190","id":2950139791,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v14-P","user":{"login":"Deozaan","id":227734,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzczNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227734?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan","html_url":"https://github.com/Deozaan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T18:35:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T18:35:01Z","body":"I don't know if this is the same thing because I haven't tried the hotkey in the file picker dialog.\n\nI have the default shortcut (Alt-⬅️) and it works inconsistently for me on Windows 10 in the scripting/documentation section of the editor.\n\nSometimes it does nothing. Sometimes it starts working after I click (which defeats the purpose of having a hotkey). Often when it works, instead of taking me to the previous script/documentation page it takes me to the top of the current documentation page. Then when I press it again, sometimes it will actually take me to the previous page.\n\nI haven't been using Godot consistently lately, so I don't have a great idea of exactly when (what version) I started experiencing these issues. I feel some of these issues have been happening for a long time (as in 4.2 or earlier, possibly as early as 4.0), but I do feel the symptoms have gotten worse and the hotkey is less reliable for me in recent releases.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950139791/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075335315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103190#issuecomment-3075335315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103190","id":3075335315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63TeST","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T20:01:10Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T20:01:10Z","body":"I can't reproduce this on 4.5.beta 1d8e73849 (Linux, KDE X11).\n\nOn AZERTY, <kbd>Ctrl + Alt + Minus</kbd> works if I add it this way:\n\n<img width=\"799\" height=\"421\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bfdce03c-1828-4d89-b901-3d40f3e697c6\" />\n\nIt'll also work this way (pressing the location of `6` in QWERTY is how you enter `-` in AZERTY):\n\n<img width=\"799\" height=\"421\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a74d645-b6ab-4092-8548-9039b4d089cb\" />\n\nBoth options work even if the file name field is currently focused.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075335315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3077910029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103190#issuecomment-3077910029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103190","id":3077910029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63dS4N","user":{"login":"RichardJECooke","id":5468805,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Njg4MDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5468805?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke","html_url":"https://github.com/RichardJECooke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_t